<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 NWER NYI POL NYONO TV</para>
  <para style="mt2">ANEB ERO BA LI GO</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONAIKA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Me Pol, a Silvanus, go Timoti, e kpꞌnyono nwer nyia tv aneb ero ba li go Tesalonaika, bo ji li ka Esowo Nsoo ejahre, a Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Nong, Esowo Nsoo, a Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre ka-n nnoobo, a elkoono.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eltim ni Pol jo kak aneb Esowo ngare nyi bo jo nyehn erem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />E bahke tiki jo ka Esowo saam ano ano, abonanee, tib wahn. Fꞌfuumu re wahr lim ano, tibre ekakesehk ejahne kpꞌgbale na, fere bꞌbudu. Elkoro enahne ni ń kpꞌkoro atemtem kpꞌtob gbal na budu fvfo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 1:2-3</char></note><verse eid="2TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Owo wahnge e kpo wor nnyo kun-n goji aneb Esowo ba li go aro nyako. Tibre wahn ebsoro asi go ekakesehk, fere kpꞌkpuumu, jol eji bo kp-n gbꞌgbak, fere jo kak-n erem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 3:2-7</char></note><verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Jia ji kpꞌtibi etingitingi elam ji Esowo, ye jio ji bahke limi, ejahbetul eje fuumu a nahne, ji wahnge no ń kpi erem nyehn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 21:36</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Esowo bahke lame elam ni nno, fere bongo ane ba kp-n erem kak, fere tob kak bo erem fvfo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 18:6-7</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Á bahk-n kake erekekv, wahn jia ji kpi erem nyehn anv, a wahr fvfo, ngare nyio nyi Ntul a Jisos bahke lohngo go ejahbetul Esowo ba, a ajꞌjok enjel enye. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Á bahke koko agun nya kpꞌlulu ba a nya, ba kak ane ba ki nyi Esowo erem, a ane ba kil wuku nnoobo etib bio bi Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Bo bahke nyehne erem bio bi elrannge go njinanjini, bi bo bahke yabe bo a Jehova. Bo nehm tiki yiimi go ege esamahr, fere bel egburu ellub ene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 20:14-15</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Nsol nyio bahke limi efung bi á bahke bake ellub ko goji ane ebe. Ane kpee ba ma taame tv-e, bahke kpoko bo esi, bo lꞌnyehn-e. Wahn fvfo, ḿ bahke tob woomo go bo ellong, tibre etib ebahre bi e tiing-n no bade efung bio, ń tꞌtaame.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ana wo e kpo kono ero kak ngare anyehng anyehng ka-n, eji Esowo lꞌlim-n, ń fuumu go elkpin ni á yehk-n no re wahn jol. Nong, Esowo gohr-n lim go ege a nsahm, eji ń lꞌlohko lim nnooba ntoobo anyehng anyehng nyi ń toobo no, fere lim eltum enahne ni ń kpꞌlimi go ekakesehk tete gohro mal, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />eji mbing nyi Jisos Ntul ewahre lꞌbel ellub go egahne, wahn tob bel ellub ene tib go nnoobo nyi Esowo ebahre, a nyi Ntul a Jisos Kraist kpo ka.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ebinne jio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Bade elbake ni Jisos Kraist, Ntul ewahre bahke bake, ana e bahke song kpir-e, fere jol a ne edi ajehng, n kp-n gboongo abonanee re, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />eltim kꞌjo gul-n eljoobo. Kana jo fahl, jol eji ane bandiki kpꞌbꞌbung re, efung bi Ntul ewahre bahke bake ebrehng. Fundiki nne nyehne amahr, fundiki nne bungu na tong-n, fundiki nne nyono na go nwer re, wahr ba kpꞌtibi elkohn eltibi ana nio.<verse eid="2TH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Kana taame, nne awohng awohng nehm-n go mbang anyehng anyehng. Tibre etingitingi, efung bio nehm rehng, sehngem re no, ane tohko ten Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 3:2</char></note> nne abiafem noo kehm lohngo ba, ye jio ji bahke jeke go ellulagun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 13:1-8</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Á bahke jo ten ejum ajehng ajehng ji li ka Esowo, a ji ane kpo kak. Á bahke jehke go etahk Esowo, fere jo rod elne bum wahre wahre, are ye Esowo bi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:15</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ń nehme kpe buumu re, eji n jolo a nahne o, n tong-n tong nsol nyiaa?<verse eid="2TH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ń kpꞌkahne ejum ji kp-e kpane,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 4:17</char></note> ji wahnge á lꞌkꞌwaka ba tete ngare enye biingi. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Abꞌbi nyao nya li mbehr mbehr, nya nya ma kehme eblohngo a. Jol abꞌbi nyao nehm tiki lohng, jol gbul gbul gbuul, tete bo fak nne noo no kpꞌkpane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 7:9</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Owo nne abiafem noo bahke kehm lohngo ba. Ntul a Jisos bahk-e wulu go elfeb ni á bahke fahle go ege a nnyo, fere ranng-e go elbake ni á bahke bake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 19:15,20</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Nne abiafem noo bahke bake go nsahm nyi nnehm, ba lim ajoobo akpokosi, fere jo lim awak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 13:11-13</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Á bahke koko abꞌbi anyehng anyehng, jo nehm ane ba bahke kpoko tan. Tibre ane bao, etingitingi nehm jo kor bo. Bo bahke tene etingitingi ji kehn jol tahre bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:28; 2 Tim 4:3-4</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Esi jio ji wahnge Esowo bahke tumu etohko ji nnehm tv bo re ba lim bo, bo taame tv nsol nyi li afahnge, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />eji ane bao kpee lꞌli ebi, bo jio ji ki taame tv etingitingi, abiafem jo kor bo go ellimi.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ane ba Esowo yehke bo re bo bel eltahre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />E bahke tiki jo kak Esowo saam tib wahn abonanee, wahn ji kpo kor Jehova, tibre Esowo yehk-n go mbomannahb re wahn bel eltahre go nsahm Etingi Etohko, nyi kpo lim re wahn jol ejahne ejahne, eji ń kpꞌtaame tv etingitingi. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Esowo yehk-n re wahn jol ana, eji ń lꞌbel ellub ni Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre, tib go nnoobo etib ebahre bi e jo tiing-n.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Abonanee, owo nobo re wahn yiimi ano tꞌtahne, kꞌtiki yake eljini nio ni e tib-n no, jol afi e nyono go nwer, afi e fere bungu na go nnyo. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre antahng antahng, a Esowo Nsoo ejahre no wahr kpo kor-e, ye jio ji ka-r alum nya ekakeltim nya li go njinanjini, fere ka-r ekunukpu ji nno tib go ege a nnoobo, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />nong, bo jo kak-n eltim, fere lim-n, wahn tahne, eji ń lꞌmal jo lim ejum ajehng ajehng ji kpꞌnobo, afi jolo elbungu, afi fere jolo eltum.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Jo kaken ero ka-r</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Abonanee, jo kaken ero ka-r, eji alum Esowo lꞌgulu elyeere, fere bel ellub, ana tob jol go egahne fvfo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 4:3</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Tob jo kaken ero fvfo, eji Esowo lꞌtahr-r yehke go abo nya abi ane. Tibre ane kpee sang kpꞌtaame tv alum Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 17:4-5</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Jehova li nkakesehk a nne, á bahk-n limi, ń tahne, fere baab-n, eji Ebinne jio lꞌki-n ma lak abo. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Jehova ma-r lim re wahr jo bum-n go etingitingi, tibre ń kpꞌlimi nsol nyi e tong-n no, ḿ bahke tiki jo lim nsol nyio ano ano.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 7:16; Gal 5:10</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Nong, Jehova lennge ntim enyahne, goji ń lꞌkahn elkoro ni Esowo, fere kahn elkpuumu ana ni Kraist kpuumu no.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana nne Esowo bahke tiki jo lim eltum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Abonanee, e kp-n tongo go mbing nyi Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre re wahn jo yab mmonanne ejahne awohng awohng no kpo lim eljini ni kil nobo, ni ki li eljini ni e tib-n no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 18:15-17; Rom 16:17</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Wahnfono antahng kpꞌkahne mbang ana nyi ḿ bahk-r toono. Tibre e belem eljini ni ki nob ngare nyi e jolo a nahne. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />E tikem ko nsol alehke nyi nne awohng awohng, kꞌka ekun. E jo bade sehng, jo lim eltum atv a njul, eji e lꞌkꞌjo tokko nne awohng awohng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 20:34-35</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Eji e jo lim ano, lohngem re, nsahm e kpimm nyi e bahke ma ko nsol alehke go egahne. E jo limi ano, tib eji ń lꞌkahn mbang nyi ḿ bahke jo toono.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 9:14-15</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ngare nyio nyi e jolo a nahne, owo e tong-n no re, “Nne awohng awohng no tohko jo lim eltum, á kꞌjo li nsol alehke.” <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Tibre wahr ebwuk re, egom ejahne jindiki kpehme lim eljini ni nno. Bo kpehme lim eltum sehngem nnyo mi bo kpo kak go afem ane. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />E kpꞌtongo elkohn ane bao, fere jo rehke bo go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos Kraist re, bo bel elkpin ni nno, fere jo lim eltum, jo le elbo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 4:11-12</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Abonanee, nong, nnoobo alimi ki-n kpen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 6:9</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌten elbumu alum nya e nyono go nwer nyia, nyonen mbing enye kak go nwer, wahn kꞌkpe jo jen a ne, eji ndon lꞌfil-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 5:9-11</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Kana ye jo rod bum ana nnekv. Nobo na re wahn jo rehk-e ana mmonanne ejahne. <verse eid="2TH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Nong, Jehova bi elkoono jo ka-n elkoono ene ngare anyehng anyehng go mbang anyehng anyehng. Nong, Jehova jol a nahne wahn ane kpee. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Me Pol wo kpꞌnyono nnyo akake mia. Ana wo n kpo kak elliingi go nwer anyehng anyehng nyi n lꞌnyon. Mbang nyia nyi n kpo kono elnyono re, <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Nong, nnoobo nyi Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre jol a nahne wahn ane kpee.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>